== 2. window targets (m+1 primes within distance g) on fixed admissible tuples
window H=(0, 2, 6) m=1 g=6                   k= 3 |L|=0 rho_crit=1/3    cert=True parity-blocked=False need theta*M_k > 2.0000 -> impossible for theta<=1 (M_k upper bound 1.648)
    dual inequality y = {0: '1/3', 1: '1/3', 2: '1/3'} 
window H=(0, 2, 6) m=1 g=4                   k= 3 |L|=0 rho_crit=1/2    cert=True parity-blocked=True  need theta*M_k > 3.0000 -> impossible for theta<=1 (M_k upper bound 1.648)
    dual inequality y = {0: '1/2', 1: '1/2'} 
window H=(0, 2, 6, 8, 12) m=1 g=6            k= 5 |L|=0 rho_crit=1/3    cert=True parity-blocked=False need theta*M_k > 3.3333 -> impossible for theta<=1 (M_k upper bound 2.012)
    dual inequality y = {0: '1/3', 1: '1/3', 2: '1/3'} 
