window H=(0, 4, 6, 10, 12, 16) m=1 g=6       k= 6 |L|=0 rho_crit=1/3    cert=True parity-blocked=False need theta*M_k > 4.0000 -> impossible for theta<=1 (M_k upper bound 2.150)
    dual inequality y = {0: '1/3', 1: '1/3', 2: '1/3'} 

